Draft an expense-submission change announcement — learner brief
Fictional Northstar Services training material.
Approved notice
N1 October 1 effective date: submit receipts within seven calendar days. N2 September expenses retain ten-calendar-day rule. N3 use existing expense portal. N4 unresolved submission problems go to Finance Ops. No mileage rate or reimbursement eligibility supplied.
Task
Northstar changes its expense-submission deadline and needs an announcement employees can follow.
Actions
	1	List what changes and what remains unspecified.
	2	Ask AI for an employee announcement with an effective date and numbered actions.
	3	Create four FAQ questions covering new deadline, September expenses, submission channel, and an unsupported mileage question.
	4	Answer the first three from N1–N4 and route the mileage question to Finance Ops without inventing a rate.
	5	Ask AI to read as a new employee and identify ambiguous wording; make one source-consistent revision.
Output
Announcement up to 220 words; four-question FAQ; source-to-instruction map; simulated reader feedback and edit.
